# Files (DESK=1: the Desktop): DESK=1 sh tests/shots.sh EMU SD files 46 T1 ... (16 shots)
# The SD card is modified (a move, a copy, a rename, a new folder, a delete): use a scratch copy.
# It needs: /docs holding only "Read me first.txt"; no other entry of / starting "sy" or
# "docs"; /SYSTEM/INIT.PRG; no /BIN/WRITE.PRG gives the "not found" alert at shot 8.
# Good shot times (s), total 46 s:
#   5.4   the Desktop, Files 1 in / (the Up button dimmed, no "..", /SYSTEM hidden)
#   10.6  ctrl-N, "docs", Enter: Files 2 in /docs: "..", "Read me first.txt" selected
#   11.2  Read me first.txt dragged from Files 2 to Files 1's header (the drag pointer)
#   15.8  dropped: moved to / (Files 1, 10 entries); Files 1 clicked, ctrl-C ("Copied ..."
#         in its footer); Files 2 clicked, ctrl-V: copied back into /docs (selected)
#   17.6  File > Rename...: the ui_ask dialog, the name all selected
#   19.0  "NOTES.MD" typed, Tab: Cancel has the focus (a dotted frame)
#   19.8  Tab again: OK has it (Space then activates it: renamed)
#   22    Enter on NOTES.MD: Write's alert ("Write was not found on the card." without it)
#   26.6  Esc; File > New folder...: Tab, Shift+Tab (back to the field), "Work" typed
#   29.5  Enter: Work made; "no", Delete: the warning alert "Delete NOTES.MD?"
#   32.5  Enter: deleted; ".." double clicked: Files 2 in / with docs selected
#   35.5  View > Show system files: SYSTEM listed
#   39.5  "sy", Enter: in /SYSTEM; "init", Enter: the alert "INIT.PRG is a system program."
#   42.2  Esc; the Up button clicked: / with SYSTEM selected
#   43.9  the View menu open: Show system files checked
#   45.5  chosen: off, SYSTEM hidden again
# The pointer starts at (320, 180); moves of at most 100 (drags 30), generated from
# absolute points. Files 1: outer (24, 24), content (25, 40); Files 2: content (49, 64);
# rows at content y 16 + 12 n; the Up button at content (2, 1) 18 x 12. Menu bar (0.14): File at
# (272, 6), View (352, 6) (after the system menus and "Files"); items from y 23, 14 apart.
6000 key rea
7000 key {dE0}n{uE0}
9000 key docs
9800 key \n
# drag Files 2's row 1 to Files 1's header strip (above Files 2)
10500 move 149 98
10700 press
10800 drag 200 44
11500 release
# Files 1: click its header strip, ctrl-C; Files 2: click its footer, ctrl-V
13000 move 250 44
13100 click
13600 key {dE0}c{uE0}
14200 move 200 272
14400 click
15000 key {dE0}v{uE0}
# File > Rename...
16000 move 272 6
16200 click
16800 move 290 65
17000 click
17800 key NOTES.MD
18500 key {d2B}{u2B}
19300 key {d2B}{u2B}
20000 key  
21000 key \n
23000 key {esc}
# File > New folder...
24000 move 272 6
24200 click
24600 move 290 51
24800 click
25300 key {d2B}{u2B}
25700 key {dE1}{d2B}{u2B}{uE1}
26000 key Work
27000 key \n
28000 key no
28700 key {d4C}{u4C}
30000 key \n
# ".." (row 0 of Files 2)
31000 move 109 86
31300 dclick
# View > Show system files
33500 move 352 6
33700 click
34100 move 380 23
34300 click
36500 key sy
37100 key \n
38000 key init
38700 key \n
40000 key {esc}
# the Up button of Files 2
41000 move 59 70
41300 click
41700 move 300 200
# View > Show system files (off)
43000 move 352 6
43200 click
43600 move 380 23
44000 click
